51ea><!--[--><div id="E8FF9270-7E98-4526-ADAC-C6E3A125B748" class="old_sm:py-25 py-15" data-test-id="item-wrapper" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><h3 class="text-center text-36 old_sm:text-32 leading-120 px-10 old_mobile:px-6" data-test-id="title-text">Donnez vie à votre projet d’aménagement grâce à nos experts</h3><!----><div data-test-id="carousel-wrapper" class="mt-18"><div class="overflow-hidden" style="margin-left:0;margin-right:0;" data-test-id="carousel" data-v-de54d4d5><div class="swiper mb-[60px] overflow-visible" style="margin-left:24px;margin-right:24px;" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="text-left old_mobile:h-full old_sm:h-auto flex flex-col" data-test="cta-card"><a href="/commencer-ici/conseil-renovation" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="old_mobile:mb-[37px] mb-6 h-[408px] old_mobile:h-[430px] w-full object-cover" data-test-id="test-image" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></a><span class="text-20 old_sm:text-24 leading-120 m-0 hyphens-auto mb-4" data-test-id="title-text">Vous pensez rénover mais ne savez pas par où commencer ?</span><div class="text-15 old_mb:text-16 old_sm:leading-[26px] old_mobile:leading-120 hyphens-auto mb-7" data-test-id="subtitle-text" data-as-attribute="content">Profitez de consultations gratuites pour découvrir notre expertise, avec rendus personnalisés, suggestions de design et solutions VELUX sur mesure.</div><a href="/commencer-ici/conseil-renovation" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-auto flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 h-8 pt-px text-11 text-old_velux-black font-400 mt-auto" target icon-color="black" data-test-id="test-button" data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><!----><span>Comment ça marche</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="text-left old_mobile:h-full old_sm:h-auto flex flex-col" data-test="cta-card"><a href="/commencer-ici/requete-contacter-un-installateur" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="old_mobile:mb-[37px] mb-6 h-[408px] old_mobile:h-[430px] w-full object-cover" data-test-id="test-image" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></a><span class="text-20 old_sm:text-24 leading-120 m-0 hyphens-auto mb-4" data-test-id="title-text">Besoin d’aide pour installer ou remplacer votre fenêtre de toit ?</span><div class="text-15 old_mb:text-16 old_sm:leading-[26px] old_mobile:leading-120 hyphens-auto mb-7" data-test-id="subtitle-text" data-as-attribute="content">Trouvez des installateurs partenaires VELUX formés et accrédités dans votre région pour discuter de votre projet et obtenir un devis non contraignant.</div><a href="/commencer-ici/requete-contacter-un-installateur" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-auto flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 h-8 pt-px text-11 text-old_velux-black font-400 mt-auto" target icon-color="black" data-test-id="test-button" data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><!----><span>Trouver un installateur</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="text-left old_mobile:h-full old_sm:h-auto flex flex-col" data-test="cta-card"><a class="inline" href="https://www.veluxshop.fr" target="_blank" data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="old_mobile:mb-[37px] mb-6 h-[408px] old_mobile:h-[430px] w-full object-cover" data-test-id="test-image" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></a><span class="text-20 old_sm:text-24 leading-120 m-0 hyphens-auto mb-4" data-test-id="title-text">Vous recherchez des stores, volets roulants et accessoires VELUX ?</span><div class="text-15 old_mb:text-16 old_sm:leading-[26px] old_mobile:leading-120 hyphens-auto mb-7" data-test-id="subtitle-text" data-as-attribute="content">Que vous souhaitiez occulter, filtrer la lumière ou encore vous protéger de la chaleur, retrouvez ici les équipements VELUX pour répondre à tous vos besoins.</div><a class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-auto flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 h-8 pt-px text-11 text-old_velux-black font-400 mt-auto" href="https://www.veluxshop.fr" target="_blank" icon-color="black" data-test-id="test-button" data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><!----><span>Accéder à la boutique en ligne</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="text-left old_mobile:h-full old_sm:h-auto flex flex-col" data-test="cta-card"><a href="/support" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="old_mobile:mb-[37px] mb-6 h-[408px] old_mobile:h-[430px] w-full object-cover" data-test-id="test-image" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></a><span class="text-20 old_sm:text-24 leading-120 m-0 hyphens-auto mb-4" data-test-id="title-text">Vous rencontrez un problème avec votre produit VELUX ? </span><div class="text-15 old_mb:text-16 old_sm:leading-[26px] old_mobile:leading-120 hyphens-auto mb-7" data-test-id="subtitle-text" data-as-attribute="content">Notre service clientèle vous aidera à trouver la solution que vous recherchez et à résoudre les problèmes les plus courants, avant et après l’achat. </div><a href="/support" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-auto flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 h-8 pt-px text-11 text-old_velux-black font-400 mt-auto" target icon-color="black" data-test-id="test-button" data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><!----><span>Accéder à notre assistance</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><div class="swiper-pagination"></div><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button left-10 hidden old_mobile:left-0 swiper-button-prev button-prev-738b5100-5122-41a0-b29b-4f5ffba8652a" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button right-10 old_mobile:right-0 swiper-button-next button-next-738b5100-5122-41a0-b29b-4f5ffba8652a" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div></div></div><section id="606785b4-b2a3-40ad-8dd7-ec4afcc32875" data-section-name="campaignblockvds-1" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><div class="bg-velux-white p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-9"><div class="bg-velux-blue-100 gap-y-24 tablet:gap-y-24 p-6 sm:p-10 vlx-grid"><!--[--><div class="text-velux-black order-1 md:col-start-14 col-span-full md:col-span-11 md:flex md:flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:self-stretch md:flex-1 md:items-start md:justify-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><span><span class="vds-font-headline-m word-break" data-heading-size="m" data-heading-bold="false" data-test="text">Promo de printemps | Économisez jusqu’à 20 %</span></span><div class="prose"><div class="word-break vds-font-body-m" data-test="body-text">Accueillez le printemps avec un contrôle optimisé de la lumière ! Économisez dès maintenant sur les stores et volets VELUX pour un équilibre parfait entre lumière naturelle et obscurité chez vous.

Offre valable uniquement sur veluxshop.fr jusqu'au 4 mai 2026.</div></div></div><!----><a data-component="CompLink" href="https://www.veluxshop.fr/reduction?ctasource=pm_campaign_oso" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:cursor-default vds-font-button-xs text-velux-button-tertiary-initial hover:text-velux-button-tertiary-hover aria-disabled:text-velux-button-tertiary-disabled gap-1 h-8 h-8" data-variant="link" data-test="comp-link" data-link-type="absolute" aria-current="page" tabindex="0"><!--[--><!----><span class="" data-test-id="comp-link-text">Acheter</span><svg class="w-2 h-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" data-test="icon-trailing"><!----><use xlink:href="/dist/velux-marketing/client/icon-sprite-90bc16c8c2b6c5fb-9f73c76f.svg#direction-chevron-right-16"></use></svg><!--]--></a></div><!----></div><div class="order-0 col-span-full md:col-span-11"><div class="w-full relative"><div class="mobile:bottom-0 tablet:bottom-0 md:right-0 mobile:translate-y-1/2 tablet:translate-y-1/2 md:translate-x-1/2 absolute z-10 mobile:right-0 tablet:right-4 md:top-10 lg:top-20"><a class="inline cursor-pointer" href="https://www.veluxshop.fr/reduction?ctasource=pm_campaign_oso" target="_blank"><!--[--><div class="w-40 h-40 lg:h-52 lg:w-52 rounded-full flex items-center flex-col justify-center p-3 gap-2 lg:p-4 lg:gap-3 text-center bg-velux-blue-600 text-velux-white"><div><!----><svg class="w-8 h-8" aria-hidden="true"><!----><use xlink:href="/dist/velux-marketing/client/icon-sprite-90bc16c8c2b6c5fb-9f73c76f.svg#generic-save-money-32"></use></svg></div><div class="prose"><div class="word-break vds-font-body-m-strong" data-test="body-text">20 %</div></div><div class="prose"><div class="word-break vds-font-body-s" data-test="body-text">de remise</div></div></div><!--]--></a></div><!--[--><div class="mediaContainer flex flex-col gap-2 relative"><div class="relative"><!----><d