></span></div><a href class="text-velux-white vds-font-button-xs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-test="instagram-mention" data-v-a61154f9></a></div><!----><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!----></div></div><!----></div><!----><!--]--></div></div></section><section id="a62e28e9-ac3c-42ac-bcdd-ffe18aaee535" data-section-name="promodefault-3" class="bg-velux-blue-100" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><div class="vlx-container vlx-grid gap-y-10"><div class="sm:col-span-6 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-13 order-2 flex flex-col col-span-full place-content-center gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><svg class="w-8 h-8" aria-hidden="true"><!----><use xlink:href="/dist/velux-marketing/client/icon-sprite-90bc16c8c2b6c5fb-9f73c76f.svg#-32"></use></svg><span><h2 class="vds-font-headline-m word-break" data-heading-size="m" data-heading-bold="false" data-test="text">Est-il temps de rénover?</h2></span><div class="prose text-velux-grey-800" data-as-attribute="content"><div class="word-break vds-font-body-m text-velux-grey-800" data-test="body-text">Nous mettons à votre disposition nos consultants en lumière naturelle. Pour vous, un service de conseil gratuit sans égal : rendus personnalisés, suggestions de design, solutions VELUX sur mesure. Enfin, un aperçu clair des coûts et des produits adaptés à vos besoins.</div></div></div><!----><a aria-current="page" href="/commencer-ici/conseil-renovation" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:cursor-default vds-font-button-xs text-velux-button-tertiary-initial hover:text-velux-button-tertiary-hover aria-disabled:text-velux-button-tertiary-disabled gap-1 self-start self-start" data-variant="link" data-test="comp-link" data-component="CompLink" data-link-type="relative" tabindex="0"><!--[--><!----><span class="" data-test-id="comp-link-text">Comment ça marche</span><svg class="w-2 h-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" data-test="icon-trailing"><!----><use xlink:href="/dist/velux-marketing/client/icon-sprite-90bc16c8c2b6c5fb-9f73c76f.svg#direction-chevron-right-16"></use></svg><!--]--></a></div><div class="sm:col-span-6 md:col-span-10 order-1 place-content-start flex flex-col place-content-center col-span-full"><!--[--><div class="mediaContainer flex flex-col gap-2 relative"><div class="relative"><!----><div class="aspect-w-1 aspect-h-1 sm:aspect-w-1 sm:aspect-h-1 md:aspect-w-1 md:aspect-h-1" data-test="media-container"><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full self-center overflow-hidden"><!--[--><picture class="w-full h-full object-cover" is-active="true" data-v-a61154f9><!--[--><source media="(min-width:1440px)" srcset="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w756, https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w756 2x"><source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w668, https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w668 2x"><source media="(min-width:413px)" srcset="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w719, https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w719 2x"><source srcset="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w364, https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w364 2x"><!--]--><img src="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w364, https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/8ce25-7f22d-d042b_1x1?v=2ef55bfd&amp;t=w364 2x" loading="lazy" alt="Attic living room with sloped ceiling and large roof windows, couple relaxing." class="w-full h-full duration-400 ease-out object-cover"></picture><!----><div class="absolute right-6 z-10 flex bottom-6 gap-1 items-end" data-v-a61154f9><div class="text-right leading-none" data-v-a61154f9><div class="" data-v-a61154f9><span class="text-velux-white vds-font-body-xs" show-lightbox="false" data-v-a61154f9></span></div><a href class="text-velux-white vds-font-button-xs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-test="instagram-mention" data-v-a61154f9></a></div><!----><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><!----></div></div><!----></div><!----><!--]--></div></div></section><div id="04BB6AE9-6B1B-4D31-A08B-A69E20AD240F" class="relative old_sm:py-40 old_mobile:py-25 old_sm:px-10 old_mobile:px-6 overflow-hidden bg-velux-yellow-100" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea data-v-2e9c5f9e><div class="old_2xl:max-w-[1920px] old_2xl:mx-auto" data-v-2e9c5f9e><div class="flex items-end justify-between pb-8 old_tablet:pb-10 old_mobile:pb-8 max-w-[70%] old_desktop:max-w-[84%] old_tablet:max-w-[87%] old_tablet:mx-0 mx-auto old_mobile:flex-col" data-v-2e9c5f9e><div class="max-w-[612px] old_tablet:max-w-[314px] old_mobile:max-w-none" data-v-2e9c5f9e><p class="text-48 leading-120 mb-8 old_tablet:text-32 old_mobile:text-36 old_tablet:mb-6 old_mobile:mb-4" data-v-2e9c5f9e>Quand on l&#39;a vu. On ne l&#39;oublie plus</p><div class="rich-text-component prose text-20 leading-120 old_tablet:text-16" style="" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-2e9c5f9e data-v-782ac476>D&eacute;couvrez comment la lumi&egrave;re du jour transforme les espaces.</div></div><div class="inline-flex gap-6 items-center old_mobile:justify-start w-full justify-center old_sm:justify-end mt-8" data-v-2e9c5f9e><span class="uppercase text-16 leading-120 tracking-60">Avant</span><!--[--><!----><button class="relative flex-none inline-flex items-center h-[38px] w-[95px] cursor-pointer rounded-[50px] bg-old_velux-black" id="headlessui-switch-37" role="switch" type="button" tabindex="0" aria-checked="false" data-headlessui-state><span class="translate-x-0 bg-old_velux-white inline-block mx-2 h-6 w-6 transform rounded-full transition duration-500"></span></button><!--]--><span class="opacity-50 uppercase text-16 leading-120 tracking-60">Après</span></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden overflow-visible old_mobile:w-full" style="margin-left:0;margin-right:0;" data-v-2e9c5f9e data-v-de54d4d5><div class="swiper overflow-visible" style="margin-left:0;margin-right:0;" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto w-fit" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="opacity-20" data-v-2e9c5f9e><div data-v-2e9c5f9e data-v-f6a5430d><div class="w-full" data-v-f6a5430d><div class="w-full old_tablet:h-[730px] old_mobile:h-[373px] object-cover mb-10 old_tablet:mb-4 old_mobile:mb-6 h-[635px]" data-v-f6a5430d data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><p class="text-16 leading-120 mb-4 old_mobile:text-13" data-v-f6a5430d>30% de nos clients regrettent de ne pas avoir choisi des fenêtres de toit plus grandes. Ne faites pas la même erreur - Pensez plus grand. Privilégiez une combinaison QUATTRO plutôt qu’une simple fenêtre de toit. </p><!----></div><!----></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto w-fit" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="opacity-20" data-v-2e9c5f9e><div data-v-2e9c5f9e data-v-f6a5430d><div class="w-full" data-v-f6a5430d><div class="w-full old_tablet:h-[730px] old_mobile:h-[373px] object-cover mb-10 old_tablet:mb-4 old_mobile:mb-6 h-[635px]" data-v-f6a5430d data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><div class="swiper-pagination"></div><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button left-10 hidden old_mobile:left-0 swiper-button-prev button-prev-6196d5ab-823a-4fba-986c-0aa06f2f739a" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button right-10 old_mobile:right-0 swiper-button-next button-next-6196d5ab-823a-4fba-986c-0aa06f2f739a" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div></div></div><div class="old_md:px-24 old_xl:px-10 px-10 old_mobile:px-6 py-25 sm:py-15" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><div class="max-w-[1920px] mx-auto"><h3 class="text-36 old_sm:text-48 leading-120 mb-10 old_sm:mb-14 old_md:mb-16">Découvrez les avantages des fenêtres de toit</h3><div class="old_xl:grid-cols-3 old_md:grid-cols-usp-grid grid gap-y-[89px] old_sm:gap-y-[56px] old_md:gap-y-[51px] old_sm:grid-cols-usp-grid-tablet old_xl:justify-around justify-between gap-x-10"><!--[--><div class="max-w-[550px]" show="false"><div class="flex gap-5 items-start"><div class="h-8 w-8 flex-none object-contain old_xl:h-10 old_xl:w-10" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><div class="inline-flex flex-col gap-[24px]"><span class="text-32 leading-120 m-0">Efficacité énergétique</span><span class="text-16 leading-120" data-as-attribute="content">Les fenêtres de toit constituent une méthode efficace pour économiser l&#39;énergie dédiée au chauffage, à la climatisation et à l&#39;éclairage, améliorant ainsi l&#39;efficacité énergétique de votre maison tout au long de l&#39;année.</span><!----></div></div></div><div class="max-w-[550px]" show="false"><div class="flex gap-5 items-start"><div class="h-8 w-8 flex-none object-contain old_xl:h-10 old_xl:w-10" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><div class="inline-flex flex-col gap-[24px]"><span class="text-32 leading-120 m-0">Utilisation optimale de l&#39;espace</span><span class="text-16 leading-120" data-as-attribute="content">Transformez n&#39;importe quel espace en tirant le meilleur de tous les mètres carrés disponibles sous votre toit, et rendez chaque recoin de votre maison plus fonctionnel.</span><!----></div></div></div><div class="max-w-[550px]" show="false"><div class="flex gap-5 items-start"><div class="h-8 w-8 flex-none object-contain old_xl:h-10 old_xl:w-10" data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><div class="inline-flex flex-col gap-[24px]"><span class="text-32 leading-120 m-0">Augmentation de la valeur immobilière</span><span class="text-16 leading-120" data-as-attribute="content">Installer des fenêtres de toit peut augmenter la valeur de votre propriété jusqu&#39;à 5,18 % par mètre carré, constituant un investissement judicieux pour l&#39;avenir.</span><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="old_sm:py-25 py-15" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea data-v-af024a92><div class="px-10 old_mobile:px-8 flex mb-14 items-center justify-between" data-v-af024a92><div class="flex flex-col max-w-200" data-v-af024a92><h3 class="old_md:text-48 flex-1 font-light" data-v-af024a92>Nos solutions</h3><!----></div><!----></div><div data-v-af024a92><div class="overflow-hidden relative" style="margin-left:0;margin-right:0;" data-v-af024a92 data-v-de54d4d5><div class="swiper mb-[60px] overflow-visible" style="margin-left:24px;margin-right:24px;" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--]--><div class="swiper-wrapper"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden flex-1 h-full" data-v-af024a92><div class="h-[435px] w-full flex-shrink-0"><a href="/produits/fenetres-de-toit/verriere-atelier" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full object-cover"><img stylelabscontenttype="Image" height="2667" thumbnailsrc="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/gateway/417241/thumbnail" stylelabscontentid="417241" width="3556" alt="XXL.tif" stylelabsfilesize="73.37" class="h-full object-cover" src="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/c5124-b5ee0-0a41a_4x3?v=759b4603"></div><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><div class="flex-1 justify-between old_mobile:mt-8 mt-6 bg-white flex flex-col text-left justify-center word-break"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><span class="text-28 old_sm:text-24 old_md:text-28 leading-120 text-old_velux-black mb-4 old_sm:mb-2 old_mobile:font-normal m-0">Verrière 3en1</span><div class="rich-text-component prose text-15 leading-18 old_sm:text-18 old_sm:leading-25 old_md:leading-26 text-old_velux-grey-700 line-clamp-4" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-782ac476>Compos&eacute;e de 3 fen&ecirc;tres dans un m&ecirc;me et unique cadre, elle permet une entr&eacute;e de lumi&egrave;re naturelle optimale et offre une vue panoramique. Cette solution est id&eacute;ale pour les pi&egrave;ces de tailles moyennes (au del&agrave; de 15m2).</div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="/produits/fenetres-de-toit/verriere-atelier" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-8 w-full flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 text-14 h-12 pt-px px-6 old_md:inline-flex old_mobile:justify-center hover:bg-old_velux-red-600 bg-old_velux-red-900 text-old_velux-white font-400 mt-8 w-full" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><span>En savoir plus</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden flex-1 h-full" data-v-af024a92><div class="h-[435px] w-full flex-shrink-0"><a href="/produits/stores-et-volets/protection-exterieure/volet-roulant" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full object-cover"><img stylelabscontenttype="Image" height="2667" thumbnailsrc="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/gateway/287613/thumbnail" stylelabscontentid="287613" width="2000" alt="141384-01-XXL.tif" stylelabsfilesize="56.22" class="h-full object-cover" src="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/b2dca-70c26-104a8_3x4?v=31b55c79"></div><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><div class="flex-1 justify-between old_mobile:mt-8 mt-6 bg-white flex flex-col text-left justify-center word-break"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><span class="text-28 old_sm:text-24 old_md:text-28 leading-120 text-old_velux-black mb-4 old_sm:mb-2 old_mobile:font-normal m-0">Volet roulant rigide</span><div class="rich-text-component prose text-15 leading-18 old_sm:text-18 old_sm:leading-25 old_md:leading-26 text-old_velux-grey-700 line-clamp-4" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-782ac476>Des canicules estivales aux blizzards hivernaux, les volets roulants emp&ecirc;chent les effets des conditions m&eacute;t&eacute;orologiques difficiles d'entrer dans la chambre &agrave; coucher et prot&egrave;gent votre sommeil tout au long de l'ann&eacute;e.</div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="/produits/stores-et-volets/protection-exterieure/volet-roulant" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-8 w-full flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 text-14 h-12 pt-px px-6 old_md:inline-flex old_mobile:justify-center hover:bg-old_velux-red-600 bg-old_velux-red-900 text-old_velux-white font-400 mt-8 w-full" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><span>En savoir plus</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden flex-1 h-full" data-v-af024a92><div class="h-[435px] w-full flex-shrink-0"><a href="/produits/stores-et-volets/protection-exterieure/volet-souple" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full object-cover"><img stylelabscontenttype="Image" height="2667" thumbnailsrc="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/gateway/287614/thumbnail" stylelabscontentid="287614" width="2000" alt="141380-01-XXL.tif" stylelabsfilesize="57.43" class="h-full object-cover" src="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/5c05c-0a403-ea43e_3x4?v=752c8eb2"></div><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><div class="flex-1 justify-between old_mobile:mt-8 mt-6 bg-white flex flex-col text-left justify-center word-break"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><span class="text-28 old_sm:text-24 old_md:text-28 leading-120 text-old_velux-black mb-4 old_sm:mb-2 old_mobile:font-normal m-0">Volet roulant souple</span><div class="rich-text-component prose text-15 leading-18 old_sm:text-18 old_sm:leading-25 old_md:leading-26 text-old_velux-grey-700 line-clamp-4" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-782ac476>Dormez toute la nuit sans &ecirc;tre d&eacute;rang&eacute; par la chaleur ou la lumi&egrave;re, r&eacute;veillez-vous en pleine forme, m&ecirc;me au plus fort de l&rsquo;&eacute;t&eacute;.</div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="/produits/stores-et-volets/protection-exterieure/volet-souple" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-8 w-full flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 text-14 h-12 pt-px px-6 old_md:inline-flex old_mobile:justify-center hover:bg-old_velux-red-600 bg-old_velux-red-900 text-old_velux-white font-400 mt-8 w-full" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><span>En savoir plus</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><div class="swiper-slide items-start h-auto" data-v-de54d4d5><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex flex-col overflow-hidden flex-1 h-full" data-v-af024a92><div class="h-[435px] w-full flex-shrink-0"><a href="/produits/fenetres-de-toit/verriere-2en1" class="inline" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full object-cover"><img stylelabscontenttype="Image" height="2667" thumbnailsrc="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/gateway/362456/thumbnail" stylelabscontentid="362456" width="3556" alt="150071-01-XXL.tif" stylelabsfilesize="76.01" class="h-full object-cover" src="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/e9994-8a11f-ec412_4x3?v=24bb0be8"></div><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><div class="flex-1 justify-between old_mobile:mt-8 mt-6 bg-white flex flex-col text-left justify-center word-break"><div class="flex flex-col h-full"><span class="text-28 old_sm:text-24 old_md:text-28 leading-120 text-old_velux-black mb-4 old_sm:mb-2 old_mobile:font-normal m-0">Verrière 2en1</span><div class="rich-text-component prose text-15 leading-18 old_sm:text-18 old_sm:leading-25 old_md:leading-26 text-old_velux-grey-700 line-clamp-4" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-782ac476><p>Cette solution moderne et innovante apporte une vue imprenable sur l&rsquo;ext&eacute;rieur tout en illuminant votre int&eacute;rieur. Elle se compose d&rsquo;une partie fixe et d&rsquo;une partie ouvrante : id&eacute;al pour ventiler vos espaces de vie.&nbsp;</p></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="/produits/fenetres-de-toit/verriere-2en1" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-8 w-full flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 text-14 h-12 pt-px px-6 old_md:inline-flex old_mobile:justify-center hover:bg-old_velux-red-600 bg-old_velux-red-900 text-old_velux-white font-400 mt-8 w-full" target data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[--><span>En savoir plus</span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><div class="swiper-pagination"></div><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button left-10 hidden old_mobile:left-0 swiper-button-prev button-prev-30710ddd-012b-4ce0-ade2-b5047b98c241" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><div class="flex w-12 h-full translate-y-0 top-0 shadow-none swiper-button right-10 old_mobile:right-0 swiper-button-next button-next-30710ddd-012b-4ce0-ade2-b5047b98c241" style="top:;" data-v-926dabaa><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----></div></div></div><div id="30D03EEC-B1D2-4395-9300-73756DA09A6F" class="pt-0 sm:pb-26 pb-15 mx-auto px-6 md:px-10" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea data-v-90670172><div class="w-full flex sm:justify-center gap-8 sm:gap-10 md:gap-[77px] flex-col md:flex-row overflow-x-auto" data-v-90670172><div class="pt-26 mobile:pt-15 flex flex-col" data-v-90670172><div class="text-16 flex gap-4 leading-120 w-full md:w-[613px] md:aspect-w-3 md:aspect-h-2" data-v-90670172><!--[--><div class="object-cover w-full" data-id="30d03eec-b1d2-4395-9300-73756da09a6f-mobImage-1" data-v-90670172 data-v-0e2b6343><!----></div><!--]--></div><div class="text-16 leading-120" data-v-90670172><!----><!----></div></div><div class="md:max-w-[1376px] w-full tablet:mx-auto" data-v-90670172><div class="md:pt-26" data-v-90670172><div class="rich-text-component prose" data-id="30d03eec-b1d2-4395-9300-73756da09a6f-mobText" data-as-attribute="content" data-v-90670172 data-v-782ac476><h4>Important &ndash; Avertissement produit  </h4>
<p>Risque de d&eacute;faut &eacute;lectrique dans une variante de fen&ecirc;tre pour toit plat VELUX causant un risque de blessure. Merci de v&eacute;rifier si vous disposez d&rsquo;un produit &agrave; risque. </p>
<strong>Attention cet avertissement ne concerne que les fen&ecirc;tres pour toit plat VELUX. </strong></div><a href="/commencer-ici/electrical-flat-roof-window-warning" class="inline vlx-button group origin-left outline-none inline-flex gap-[0.5rem] place-items-center mt-6 w-max hover:text-velux-white flex flex-row items-center leading-115 duration-[400ms] tracking-1 font-w-60 border border-solid text-14 h-12 pt-px px-6 hover:bg-old_velux-red-600 border-old_velux-black text-old_velux-black font-400 mt-6 w-max hover:text-velux-white" target data-v-90670172 data-v-77722986><!--[--><!--[-->Plus d’informations ici<!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:pb-30 md:pb-25 pb-16 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-9" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><div class="bg-velux-grey-100 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-8 lg:gap-y-4 vlx-grid-24 items-center py-8 sm:py-10 md:py-12 px-10 md:px-0"><div class="col-span-full md:max-w-[914px] md:col-start-2 md:col-span-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-baseline md:items-center gap-x-16 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-8"><!----><div class="grid gap-y-3"><span><span class="vds-font-headline-m word-break" data-heading-size="m" data-heading-bold="false" data-test="text">Vous êtes architecte, distributeur, installateur ou constructeur de maisons ?</span></span><span class="text-old_velux-initial-black opacity-[64%] text-14 md:text-16 lg:text-20 font-w-45 sm:font-w-60 leading-135">Explorez notre section dédiée aux professionnels. Vous y trouverez des documentations, des outils, des calculateurs, des ressources techniques, un visualiseur de lumière du jour, ainsi que des informations sur nos programmes de partenariat.</span></div></div><div class="w-fit col-span-full md:justify-self-end md:col-start-21 md:col-span-3 whitespace-nowrap"><a href="/professionnels" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:cursor-default vds-font-button-s h-12 bg-velux-button-primary-initial hover:bg-velux-button-primary-hover text-velux-white aria-disabled:bg-velux-button-primary-disabled aria-disabled:text-velux-grey-50 px-6 gap-1" data-variant="link" data-test="comp-link" data-component="CompLink" data-link-type="relative" tabindex="0" link="/professionnels"><!--[--><!----><span class="" data-test-id="comp-link-text">Découvrez plus d'informations</span><!----><!--]--></a></div></div></div><section class="vlx-container grid gap-10 md:gap-16" placeholder-name="main" language="fr-FR" data-v-d18451ea><div class="grid gap-10 md:gap-12"><div class="vlx-grid"><div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-8"><div class="prose text-velux-grey-800" data-as-attribute="content"><p class="word-break vds-font-body-m text-velux-grey-800" data-test="body-text">Magazine</p></div><span class="text-velux-black"><h2 class="vds-font-headline-l word-break" data-heading-size="l" data-heading-bold="false" data-test="text">Plongez dans un monde où la lumière naturelle est mise à l'honneur</h2></span><div class="prose text-velux-grey-800" data-as-attribute="content"><p class="word-break vds-font-body-m text-velux-grey-800" data-test="body-text">Découvrez le Magazine VELUX et trouvez de l'inspiration pour transformer votre espace grâce à la lumière du jour. Vous y trouverez des articles, des témoignages de propriétaires et des interviews d'experts prêts à vous guider dans la renovation de votre habitat.</p></div></div></div><div class="vlx-grid gap-y-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 col-span-full sm:col-span-12"><!--[--><div class="mediaContainer flex flex-col gap-2 relative"><div class="relative"><!----><div class="aspect-w-4 aspect-h-3 sm:aspect-w-4 sm:aspect-h-3 md:aspect-w-4 md:aspect-h-3" data-test="media-container"><!--[--><div class="w-full h-full self-center overflow-hidden"><!--[--><picture class="w-full h-full object-cover" is-active="true" data-v-a61154f9><!--[--><source media="(min-width:1440px)" srcset="https://contenthub.velux.com/api/public/content/