ue":"Volet roulant rigide"},"tagtext":{"value":""},"text":{"value":"Des canicules estivales aux blizzards hivernaux, les volets roulants emp&ecirc;chent les effets des conditions m&eacute;t&eacute;orologiques difficiles d'entrer dans la chambre &agrave; coucher et prot&egrave;gent votre sommeil tout au long de l'ann&eacute;e."},"image":{"value":{"stylelabscontenttype":"Image","src":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontenthub.velux.com\u002Fapi\u002Fpublic\u002Fcontent\u002Fb2dca-70c26-104a8_3x4?v=31b55c79","height":"2667","thumbnailsrc":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontenthub.velux.com\u002Fapi\u002Fgateway\u002F287613\u002Fthumbnail","stylelabscontentid":"287613","width":"2000","alt":"141384-01-XXL.tif","stylelabsfilesize":"56.22"}},"linkText":{"value":"En savoir plus"},"link":{"value":{"href":"\u002Fproduits\u002Fstores-et-volets\u002Fprotection-exterieure\u002Fvolet-roulant","id":"{40397144-60DC-43E4-BA07-21FD1344E610}","querystring":"","target":"","text":"","anchor":"","title":"","class":"","url":"\u002FInternet\u002FMarketingSite\u002Fhome\u002Fproduct\u002Fblinds-and-shutters\u002Fexterior-sunscreening\u002Froller-shutters","linktype":"internal"}},"id":"53a4357a-dc01-47ca-85ce-b02de421630e","name":"Roller Shutter - HOMEPAGE FR","template":"Product Promo Card"},{"title":{"value":"Volet roulant souple"},"tagtext":{"value":""},"text":{"value":"Dormez toute la nuit sans &ecirc;tre d&eacute;rang&eacute; par la chaleur ou la lumi&egrave;re, r&eacute;veillez-vous en pleine forme, m&ecirc;me au plus fort de l&rsquo;&eacute;t&eacute;."},"image":{"value":{"stylelabscontenttype":"Image","src":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontenthub.velux.com\u002Fapi\u002Fpublic\u002Fcontent\u002F5c05c-0a403-ea43e_3x4?v=752c8eb2","height":"2667","thumbnailsrc":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontenthub.velux.com\u002Fapi\u002Fgateway\u002F287614\u002Fthumbnail","stylelabscontentid":"287614","width":"2000","alt":"141380-01-XXL.tif","stylelabsfilesize":"57.43"}},"linkText":{"value":"En savoir plus"},"link":{"value":{"href":"\u002Fprodu